 "description": "<p>Christmas styling on a plush bunny base: rabbit ears, neck ring, top, and thong in polyester, pink or red, one size for 40-60 kg. The plush texture is what makes this a December set rather than a year-round one.</p>\n<p>Four pieces, with the rabbit ears and neck ring carrying both themes at once - bunny silhouette plus holiday color. Pink and red split the register: pink leans cute, red leans Christmas classic.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester plush</li>\n<li>Includes: rabbit ears, neck ring, top, thong</li>\n<li>Style: Christmas bunny</li>\n<li>Color: pink or red</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. The soft option in the Christmas category for anyone whose December plans involve a fireplace.</p>\n",
